Title: My Poem Portfolio
Overview:I have successfuly created a portfolio for my writting works. My goal was to set out to create a home page to access other different pages that display my works. I have successfully ensure that you can change the text size, text color, and the backgrounf color too. On the home page, there's a list of all my uploaded works. You can sort the list by the information given.
Target Audience: The main audience is me and anyone who is intrested in my work. If anyone wants to read through my stuff, they can just find the sight and explore. In the past I've had people tell me that the way I shared my works put strain on their eyes. With the custom features, that shouldn't be an issue anymore.
Core Features: In HTML there are paragraphs, tabels, headders, inputs, and even buttons. In CSS, there's all the styles and changes of how the websight looks. The text is asjustable. With JavaScript, I was able to make the table dynamic and sortable, as well as all the buttons and inputs actually do something.
Design and UX Considerations: The CSS part was difucult for me. I defently need some more practice with it. I don't have a great ethstetic eye, but I hope my sight looks good enough. It took a lot of trial and error, as well as looking back at past works on Zlabs, but I think it's in a pretty good presentable state now. The UI is pretty simple and self explanitory I feel.
Challenges and Solutions: I had a lot of challanges. The CSS and getting everything to be centered and also work on smaller screens was a headach. It's still not even perfect, but it works. The sorting was also a headache. I had to relearn the .sort() function. I very much didn't understand it before, but now I get it.
Lessons Learned: I didn't realize how difucult and time consuming it was to make a websight, especally a good one. This project is pretty simple but it took me a long time and a lot of brain power. I have so much more respect for websights now. Hopefully I can contime to imporve on this project and make it an actual sight I can send people to if I ever need to Share my works.
